Dan 6:1 , Daniel is made chief of the presidents;
Dan 6:4 , They, conspiring against him, obtain an idolatrous decree;
Dan 6:10 , Daniel, accused of the breach thereof, is cast into the lion's den;
Dan 6:18 , Daniel is saved;
Dan 6:24 , his adversaries devoured;
Dan 6:25 , and God magnified by a decree.
